  "prefLabel": "Cor 411.05 Residents Required to Follow Rules",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Cor 411.05 Residents Required to Follow Rules. Residents at transitional housing units shall follow the rules and orders provided by the staff. Any failure to follow rules and orders shall result in the resident being removed from the program.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Cor 400) #12887, eff 9-29-19",
